---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="소개">
  <section class="sw-about">
    <div class="sw-about-aside">소개</div>
    <div class="sw-about-body">
      <h1 class="sw-title">김원</h1>
      <dl class="sw-ident">
        <dt>이름</dt>
        <dd>김원 · <span class="sw-cjk">金源</span> · Won Kim</dd>
        <dt>핸들</dt>
        <dd><a href="https://github.com/cmygray" rel="me">cmygray</a></dd>
        <dt>사이트</dt>
        <dd>two.kim</dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="sw-prose">
        <p>소프트웨어를 만듭니다. 개발하면서 배운 것들, 생각한 것들을 기록합니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
